    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Earn 100,000 yen per night! Late-night traffic survey part-time job!</h2>A part-time job counting passing vehicles along Japan's roads with little pedestrian traffic.<br>It's a simple task, but the reward is an astonishing 100,000 yen!?<br><br>However, letting your guard down is not an option. Eerie anomalies lurk in the darkness of the night!<br><br>The anomalies will gradually erode your sanity...<br>Take photos to quickly make the anomalies disappear!<br><br>Maintain your focus on counting vehicles and your sanity as you confront the anomalies!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25bcTraffic Survey</h2>Press the button each time a vehicle passes.<br>Pressing the button will count the vehicle. Missing any is strictly forbidden, okay?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2829760/extras/687386fca43c9445843ff2dc3e7e3916.poster.avif?t=1744099795\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2829760/extras/687386fca43c9445843ff2dc3e7e3916.webm?t=1744099795\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2829760/extras/687386fca43c9445843ff2dc3e7e3916.mp4?t=1744099795\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25bcCollect Anomalies</h2>Your sanity decreases while anomalies are present. It's possible to make them disappear by taking photos!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2829760/extras/0a2bf4b3c76fad846acf5ae8d9805c7b.poster.avif?t=1744099795\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2829760/extras/0a2bf4b3c76fad846acf5ae8d9805c7b.webm?t=1744099795\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2829760/extras/0a2bf4b3c76fad846acf5ae8d9805c7b.mp4?t=1744099795\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
